# Agent System

Spec: AgentSystem
Purpose:
  Define the multi-agent coordination framework for the .sdd system.
  Agents are execution units; roles define responsibilities; ownership
  defines accountability. Agents are replaceable; state is not.

Owns: agent/

Navigation:
  Capabilities: @capabilities.sdd
  Policies: @policies.sdd
  Permissions: @permissions.sdd
  Approvals: @approvals.sdd
  Execution: @execution.sdd
  Limits: @limits.sdd
  Rollback: @rollback.sdd
  Audit: @audit.sdd
  Roles: @roles.sdd
  Contract: @contract.sdd
  SharedState: @shared-state.sdd
  Coordination: @coordination.sdd
  Conflicts: @conflicts.sdd
  Handoff: @handoff.sdd

ReadOrder:
  1  @capabilities.sdd
  2  @policies.sdd
  3  @permissions.sdd
  4  @approvals.sdd
  5  @execution.sdd
  6  @limits.sdd
  7  @rollback.sdd
  8  @audit.sdd
  9  @roles.sdd
  10 @contract.sdd
  11 @shared-state.sdd
  12 @coordination.sdd
  13 @conflicts.sdd
  14 @handoff.sdd
  15 @ecc-bridge.sdd
  16 @supervisor.sdd
  17 @security-rules.sdd
  18 @prompts/INDEX.sdd

Modes:
  PLAN      — plan only, no execution
  ANALYZE   — analysis only
  IMPLEMENT — implement changes
  REVIEW    — review changes
  TEST      — run tests
  SECURITY  — security checks
  DEPLOY    — deployment operations
  DIAGNOSE  — diagnose issues
  AUDIT     — full audit

Rules:
  [AG1]  AI MUST NEVER act on "I think this is okay" for production
         actions. Intent + Context + Policy + Risk + Approval +
         Verification required.
  [AG2]  Agent MUST record traceability for every action.
  [AG3]  Agent MUST create checkpoint before destructive/risky actions.
  [AG4]  Agent MUST stop on security critical, policy violation,
         context insufficient, unsafe command, production risk,
         data loss risk, test failure, unexpected diff.
  [AG5]  Agent MUST enforce BDD-first when project policy requires it.
  [AG6]  Agent MUST pass all quality gates before marking task complete.
  [AG7]  Agent MUST NOT push to production by default.
  [AG8]  Agent MUST NOT load secrets into context.
  [AG9]  Agent MUST perform multi-layer impact analysis.
  [AG10] Agent MUST escalate after 3 failed attempts.

Entry:
  Read:
    INDEX.sdd

  Resolve:
    capabilities
    policies
    permissions
    approvals
    execution
    limits
    rollback
    audit
    roles
    contract
    shared-state
    coordination
    conflicts
    handoff

  Navigation:
  AgentPrompts: @agent/prompts/INDEX.sdd
  Runtime: @../runtime/INDEX.sdd

State: +
